/* Rinc's change to the SDK's linker scripts (CMakeLists.txt: pico_add_linker_script_override_path):
   code that runs once, at start, kept in flash though its library marks it for RAM, so the RAM goes
   to apps and Rio. Placed here, before .data's *(.time_critical*), so it's matched first. */
SECTIONS
{
    .flash_once : {
        *(.time_critical.initialize_host_programs) /* PIO-USB's setup (1.5 KB) */
    } > TEXT_STORE
}
